{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine\/statestream(bufferingpolicy:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine","doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine"]]},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C11stateStream15bufferingPolicyScSyq_GScS12ContinuationV09BufferingG0Oyq___G_tF","modules":[{"name":"MiamiStateMachine"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stateStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"bufferingPolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama","text":"StateStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV","text":"Continuation"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV15BufferingPolicyO","text":"BufferingPolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama","text":"StateStream"}],"title":"stateStream(bufferingPolicy:)"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a stream of the states the state machine is at. It starts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the current state, followed by the state entered by every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transition made from now on, in the order they are made."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stateStream","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"bufferingPolicy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StateStream","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/StateStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Continuation","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"BufferingPolicy","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV15BufferingPolicyO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = .unbounded) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StateStream","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/StateStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"How states are buffered until they are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consumed. By default all of them, without any limit. A consumer only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"interested in where the state machine is now, and not in the states","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it passed on the way, can use ","type":"text"},{"code":".bufferingNewest(1)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"name":"bufferingPolicy"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A new stream of states, starting with the current state."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The current state is delivered at once, so a stream tells where the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state machine is whenever it is created. This makes it a good fit for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a user interface. To know how a state was entered, or to not miss any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transition, use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transitionStream"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A transition leading back to the same state delivers the state again."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A rejected event delivers nothing, as the state machine stays where it is."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every call creates a new stream, independent of all other streams."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Several consumers can each have a stream of their own, and all of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them get every state. Cancelling the task of a consumer, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"letting go of a stream, ends only that stream."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The stream finishes when the state machine reaches an ending state,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after delivering that state. A stream created at an ending state","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivers the state and finishes. The stream also finishes if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"state machine is deallocated.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/stateStream(bufferingPolicy:)"},"references":{"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine/StateMachine/stateStream(bufferingPolicy:)":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine\/statestream(bufferingpolicy:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a stream of the states the state machine is at. It starts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the current state, followed by the state entered by every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transition made from now on, in the order they are made."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/stateStream(bufferingPolicy:)","title":"stateStream(bufferingPolicy:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stateStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"bufferingPolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"StateStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Continuation","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BufferingPolicy","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV15BufferingPolicyO"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"StateStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama"}]},"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine/StateMachine/StateStream":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"StateStream"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"StateMachine.StateStream","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"StateStream"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A stream of the states a state machine is at, one after the other."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/StateStream","url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine\/statestream","role":"symbol"},"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MiamiStateMachine","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine"},"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine/StateMachine":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"StateMachine","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A state machine is an actor with a current state and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a set of transitions defining the machine. The "},{"code":"TransitionRule","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connects two states by an event trigger."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"StateMachine"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"StateMachine","url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine"}}}